adback/validator output with `student_display_eligible_final` fail-closed behind source, visual, receipt, rights, and Method gates.\n\n## Notes\n\n- The full KG artifact is compacted to 94,407,622 bytes so it stays below GitHub's 100 MB hard limit and AO's 95 MB target.\n- No frontend display changes and no Supabase mutation.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/kg-v1-runtime-spine.test.js`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-v1-runtime-kg-spine.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/kg-v1-runtime-spine.test.js`\n- `npm run lint:changed`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n","created_at":"2026-07-05T10:03:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T10:06:55Z","closed_at":"2026-07-05T10:06:55Z","merged_at":"2026-07-05T10:06:55Z","merge_commit_sha":"68d83dabdb1345f943e2a99e173baee36e78e239","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1303/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1303/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1303/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/48cfa10cb1c89b906bd17d9c494df58cf1634611","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1286","ref":"feat/issue-1286","sha":"48cfa10cb1c89b906bd17d9c494df58cf1634611","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/fo